  <Title type="string">Notes on silence, in three coats of varnish</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Dmitri Vasquez talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</synopsis>
